# 📘 InteractEd Curriculum Platform • Full Stack Architecture & Integration Guide

> **Document ID:** `CURRICULUM_INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE.md`  
> **Target Audience:** Frontend Engineers, Backend Engineers, Educational Product Designers  
> **Scope:** Relational Database Schema, Supabase Storage, REST Endpoints, Frontend UI Components, Socratic Scaffolding, Gamification & Child Safety Protocols.

