## 1. Executive System Overview

The **InteractEd Curriculum Platform** transforms standard K-12 textbooks (starting with NCERT Grade 5 Mathematics & Science/EVS) into an immersive, character-driven, 100x learning experience.

Rather than rendering flat PDF pages or static text, the platform operates on a **9-table relational instructional design database**:
1. **Curriculum Books** (`curriculum_books`): Top-level textbooks with NEP 2020 alignment.
2. **Curriculum Units** (`curriculum_units`): Thematic units with teacher facilitation guides.
3. **Curriculum Chapters** (`curriculum_chapters`): Story-driven chapters with pedagogical guide characters.
4. **Curriculum Sections / Lessons** (`curriculum_sections`): Granular learning chunks (10–15 minute sessions).
5. **Instructional Blocks** (`curriculum_blocks`): Modular building blocks (Dialogue scenes, textbook text, concepts, diagrams, activities).
6. **Visual Media Assets** (`curriculum_media`): High-resolution diagrams, figures, and maps served via Supabase CDN.
7. **Formative Questions & Socratic Scaffolding** (`curriculum_questions`): Questions with cognitive misconception diagnosis and 3-tier hint ladders.
8. **Quest Mastery Badges & XP** (`curriculum_badges`): Chapter-specific gamification rewards and quests.
9. **Tap-to-Learn Glossary** (`curriculum_glossary`): Interactive vocabulary popovers with phonetic audio and child-friendly definitions.

